hchandra-yb","html_url":"https://github.com/shamanthchandra-yb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamanthchandra-yb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamanthchandra-yb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamanthchandra-yb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamanthchandra-yb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamanthchandra-yb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamanthchandra-yb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamanthchandra-yb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamanthchandra-yb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shamanthchandra-yb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/3445110160","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/28490#issuecomment-3445110160","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/28490","id":3445110160,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc7NWDWQ","user":{"login":"iSignal","id":8207010,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyMDcwMTA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8207010?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSignal","html_url":"https://github.com/iSignal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSignal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSignal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSignal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSignal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSignal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSignal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSignal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSignal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iSignal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-10-24T22:30:03Z","updated_at":"2025-10-24T22:30:03Z","body":"The issue seems to be that during the initial relcache build (YbLoadRelations), we accept invalidation messages which delete the relcache entry for some (critical) catalog tables like oid 2662 `pg_class_oid_index`. This can happen because an ANALYZE running in the background can update reltuples counts for such catalog tables and invalidate those tuples in the catalog/relcache. Such inval msgs are applied any time a lock is applied, including those on catalog tables like pg class taken during relcache build.\n\nPG seems to consider this possibility at https://github.com/postgres/postgres/blob/14ee8e6403001c3788f2622cdcf81a8451502dc2/src/backend/utils/cache/relcache.c#L6599 but some of our code modifications do not.\n\n```\n2025-10-24 19:47:20.653 UTC [13244] DEBUG:  relcache removing tuple for relation 16385:2662\n2025-10-24 19:47:20.653 UTC [13244] DEBUG:  YbPgInheritsCacheRelCallback for relid 2662\n2025-10-24 19:47:20.653 UTC [13244] DEBUG:  relcache removing tuple for relation 16385:2663\n2025-10-24 19:47:20.653 UTC [13244] DEBUG:  YbPgInheritsCacheRelCallback for relid 2663\n2025-10-24 19:47:20.653 UTC [13244] DEBUG:  relcache removing tuple for relation 16385:3455\n2025-10-24 19:47:20.653 UTC [13244] DEBUG:  YbPgInheritsCacheRelCallback for relid 3455\n2025-10-24 19:47:20.653 UTC [13244] DEBUG:  full cache refresh skipped after applying 1 message lists, updating local catalog version from 381 to 382 for database 16385\n2025-10-24 19:47:20.653 UTC [13244] DEBUG:  AcceptInvalidationMessages: updated via inval msgs to 382\n2025-10-24 19:47:20.653 UTC [13244] PANIC:  could not open critical system index 2662\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/3445110160/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"con